  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "It makes no difference",
     "texto": [
      "To say that doing something makes no difference, because the result is the same, use **-(으)나 마나**: 가다 → **가나 마나** (it makes no difference to go), 먹다 → **먹으나 마나** (it makes no difference to eat), 물어보다 → **물어보나 마나** (I already know the answer).",
      "물어보나 마나예요 = asking makes no difference, I already know the answer."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Far from it",
     "texto": [
      "**-기는커녕** says that something is far from what is said, or that the opposite happens: 부자**이기는커녕** 가난해요 = far from being rich, (he/she) is poor. 칭찬하**기는커녕** 혼냈어요 = instead of praising, (he/she) scolded.",
      "It is the opposite of what was expected."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
